# "Soul Brother" — Boom Bap
# BeatForge Studio

bpm 92
swing 45
steps 32
kit 808

# Master
reverb 0.25
delay 0.15
enhancer 0.20
width 1.10

# Drums — heavy swing, classic feel
kick     "x......ox..x.....x......ox..x...."
snare    "....x.......x.......x.......x..."
hh       "x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x."
oh       "..............x...............x."
rim      "..x...........x...x...........x."

# Drum mix
vol kick 0.85
vol snare 0.75
vol hh 0.50
vol rim 0.35
pan hh -0.15
lpf hh 6000
sendverb snare 0.20
senddly rim 0.25
sidechain kick hh

# Walking bass
scale C minor
note "C2 C2 ~ ~ Eb2 Eb2 ~ ~ F2 ~ G2 ~ Ab2 ~ ~ ~ C2 C2 ~ ~ Eb2 Eb2 ~ ~ F2 ~ G2 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"

# Soul chords
chord "Cm7 Fm7 Gm7 Fm7"
